      "created": 1788317383,
      "updated": 1788317391
    },
    {
      "id": "6a978ec70000000000b35ab6",
      "text": "[お茶.icon]の背景を白色にして[_ [お茶.icon]]にする。",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1788317383,
      "updated": 1788317543
    },
    {
      "id": "6a978ec70000000000b35ab7",
      "text": "[_ 文には適用されないようにする]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1788317383,
      "updated": 1788317383
    },
    {
      "id": "6a978f6d0000000000b35ac1",
      "text": "[アイコンの背景を透明にするUserCSS]とどっちが良いかな",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1788317548,
      "updated": 1788317558
    },
    {
      "id": "6a978ec70000000000b35ab8",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1788317383,
      "updated": 1788317383
    },
    {
      "id": "6a978ec70000000000b35ab9",
      "text": "code:style.css",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1788317383,
      "updated": 1788317383
    },
    {
      "id": "6a978ec70000000000b35aba",
      "text": " .deco-_ > a.link.icon > :is(img.icon, img.inline-icon) {",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1788317383,
      "updated": 1788317383
    },
    {
      "id": "6a978ec70000000000b35abb",
      "text": " \tbackground-color: var(--page-bg, transparent) !important;",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1788317383,
      "updated": 1788317383
    },
    {
      "id": "6a978ec70000000000b35abc",
      "text": " }",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1788317383,
      "updated": 1788317383
    },
    {
      "id": "6a978ec70000000000b35abd",
      "text": " ",
